{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"带着不舍往前时，他发现那种亲近安稳反而离自己更近，又尝到当初相信它时的快乐。\",\n      \"key\": \"反而离自己更近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他以前总想退回来守住那种日子，如今却不愿看着妨碍它的事照旧，还是接下眼前的难事。\",\n      \"key\": \"妨碍它的事照旧\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再把舍不得当成拖累，想到眼前的事是为那种日子争取机会，积着的劲终于能使出来。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得当成拖累\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他会留意自己是不是又在硬撑，怕争取到最后反把自己想要的亲近安稳耗掉。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近安稳耗掉\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己立刻证明什么，心里松了些，可那种亲近安稳的日子还没过上，尽力也未必能让它到来。\",\n      \"key\": \"立刻证明什么\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"往后他累了，仍可能怕争取会伤到那种日子，想退回去歇着。\",\n      \"key\": \"想退回去歇着\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他能暂时停下来，仍清楚自己想要的是那种亲近安稳的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"清楚自己想要\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留带着牵挂行动后旧愿反而更近，以及旧日快乐回返。将两者写成同一次真实的情感回返，不再另加快乐并非理所当然的作者总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去想退回来守住旧愿、如今发现退避护不住它而继续承担的关键反转。R67与R68重复的不愿袖手旁观合并，行动理由落在他不愿看着妨碍那种生活的事照旧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿与行动共同推动他的变化，以及依恋不再成为行动拖累。改成眼前的事是在为那种生活争取机会，让力量释放有具体来由，不再宣布两种心意已经完成整合。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把投入不保证实现、坚持不能耗尽所爱的限制，落到他留意自己是否又在硬撑，以及尽力也未必能带来想要的生活。用具体的代价取代抽象的行动原则和价值判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"两条都保留结果未知，合成眼前难事尚未解决、亲近安稳的生活还没过上、尽力也未必能让它到来，避免重复说不知道最后能留下多少。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来疲惫、可能因代价动摇的事实，改成累了以后仍会怕争取伤到所爱而想退回去歇着，不再补充整合不等于冲突消失的哲理性免责声明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆并\",\n      \"why\": \"不再单独总结不拿一种满足遮住另一种需要。旧日欢喜真实发生过，写在S13-1；心愿尚未实现也没有让他放下眼前的事，写在S13-2。两边的真实性由经历和行动体现，不再用整齐的对照句宣布。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再要求更多证明才肯向前，放进不再逼自己立刻证明什么、允许自己稍稍松下来的变化。结尾只留下仍清楚的生活愿望，不再重复靠不遗忘任何一边换取安稳的原则。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d48b8785-28ae-4044-9df8-65544a68e771", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T111224179909Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1124.89, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:31:09.073637+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5481393100811560fc0da36bfb970c6df72e6d93a347e31aec96dbd7b9389249", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T111224179909Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ac2094f7be377f5b76804c4ab5b02e3d63c2b5bcdfe50f758549d1acfc51f76e"}}}
